      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "So speed = 240 ÷ 12 = 20 m/s.\nThen train length = 20 × 8 = 160 m.\n\nMemory hook: extra object length ÷ extra time = train speed.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
