      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "The same subtraction works with two platforms. A train crosses 140 m in 18 s and 260 m in 24 s.\n\nThe platform grows by 120 m and time grows by 6 s.\nSo speed = 120/6 = 20 m/s.",
